# Copyright (C) 2026 InvoiceClosure module
# English language file of the Invoice closure module

# Module
ModuleInvoiceClosureName=Invoice closure
ModuleInvoiceClosureDesc=Adds a business status "Closed" after the standard "Paid" status of a customer invoice, without modifying the Dolibarr core.
InvoiceClosure=Invoice closure
InvoiceClosureColumn=Closure
InvoiceClosureSetup=Setup - Invoice closure
InvoiceClosureSetupDesc=Settings of the business status "Closed" of customer invoices. The standard Dolibarr status "Paid" is never modified by this module.
InvoiceClosureAbout=About - Invoice closure
InvoiceClosureAboutWorkflow=Managed workflow: Draft → Validated → Paid → Closed. The closure is a complementary business status: the invoice remains "Paid" for Dolibarr.
InvoiceClosureApiEndpoint=REST API endpoint

# Actions and buttons
CloseInvoice=Close invoice
ReopenInvoiceClosure=Reopen closure
ConfirmCloseInvoice=Confirm the closure of this invoice? Its Dolibarr status will remain "Paid".
ConfirmReopenInvoice=Confirm the reopening of this invoice? It will return to the business status "Paid" without becoming unpaid.
InvoiceClosureSuccessful=The invoice has been closed successfully.
InvoiceClosureReopened=The closure of the invoice has been reopened.

# Status and display
InvoiceClosed=Closed
InvoiceNotClosed=Not closed
InvoiceClosedBadgeHelp=Business status of the Invoice closure module. The standard Dolibarr status remains "Paid".
InvoiceClosureBusinessStatus=Business status (closure)
ClosureDate=Closure date
ClosedBy=Closed by
ClosureNote=Closure note
ReopenNote=Reopen note
LastReopenDate=Last reopening
ReopenedBy=reopened by
InvoiceClosureHistory=Closure history
InvoiceClosureSource=Source
InvoiceClosureRequestId=Request id
InvoiceClosureActionClose=Closure
InvoiceClosureActionReopen=Reopening

# Agenda
InvoiceClosureAgendaClose=Invoice %s closed (business status)
InvoiceClosureAgendaReopen=Closure of invoice %s reopened (business status)

# Errors
InvoiceMustBePaidBeforeClosure=The invoice must be paid before its closure.
InvoiceMustBeFullyPaidBeforeClosure=The invoice must be fully paid (zero remain to pay) before its closure.
InvoiceRemainToPayNotZero=The remain to pay of this invoice is not zero.
InvoiceAlreadyClosed=This invoice is already closed.
InvoiceNotClosedError=This invoice is not closed.
NoPermissionToCloseInvoice=You do not have the permission to close this invoice.
NoPermissionToReopenInvoice=You do not have the permission to reopen the closure of this invoice.
InvoiceClosureErrInvoiceNotFound=Invoice not found.
InvoiceClosureErrNotCustomerInvoice=This operation is only possible on a customer invoice.
InvoiceClosureErrEntityMismatch=This invoice does not belong to the current entity.
InvoiceClosureErrNoInvoiceReadRight=You do not have access to this invoice.
InvoiceClosureErrAbandoned=An abandoned invoice cannot be closed.
InvoiceClosureReopenDisabled=Reopening of the closure is disabled in the module setup.
InvoiceClosureCloseNoteRequired=The closure note is mandatory.
InvoiceClosureReopenNoteRequired=The reopen note is mandatory.
InvoiceClosureErrInvalidRequestId=The request id is invalid (allowed characters: letters, digits, dot, dash, underscore; 64 characters maximum).
InvoiceClosureErrTechnical=Technical error during the closure operation. Check the logs.
InvoiceClosureLockedError=Invoice %s is closed and locked: this operation is not allowed.

# Setup
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_REQUIRE_ZERO_REMAIN=Require a remain to pay equal to zero
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_REQUIRE_ZERO_REMAINHelp=If yes, only a fully paid invoice (zero remain to pay) can be closed. If no, any invoice with the standard status "Paid" can be closed, including invoices classified paid with a reason (discount, loss, etc.).
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_LOCK_CLOSED_INVOICES=Lock closed invoices
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_LOCK_CLOSED_INVOICESHelp=If yes, modifications (header, lines, deletion, back to unpaid, payment deletion) of a closed invoice are blocked server side, except for users with the "Force" permission.
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_ALLOW_REOPEN=Allow reopening
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_ALLOW_REOPENHelp=If yes, authorized users can reopen the closure of an invoice (business status only).
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_REQUIRE_CLOSE_NOTE=Mandatory closure note
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_REQUIRE_CLOSE_NOTEHelp=If yes, a note must be entered when closing.
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_REQUIRE_REOPEN_NOTE=Mandatory reopen note
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_REQUIRE_REOPEN_NOTEHelp=If yes, a note must be entered when reopening.
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_CREATE_AGENDA_EVENT=Create an event in the agenda
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_CREATE_AGENDA_EVENTHelp=If yes, every closure and reopening creates an automatic event in the Dolibarr agenda (if the Agenda module is enabled).
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_SHOW_IN_INVOICE_LIST=Show the closure in the invoice list
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_SHOW_IN_INVOICE_LISTHelp=If yes, a "Closure" column and dedicated filters are added to the customer invoice list.
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_SHOW_BADGE=Show the badge on the invoice card
SetupINVOICECLOSURE_SHOW_BADGEHelp=If yes, a "Closed" badge is displayed next to the standard status in the banner of the invoice card.
